hymns.body:
Praise God, from whom all blessings flow;
<br>Praise Him, all creatures here below;
<br>Praise Him above, ye heav'nly host;
<br>Praise Father, Son, and Holy Ghost.

Cast thy burden upon the Lord,
<br>And He shall sustain thee;
<br>He never will suffer the righteous to fall;
<br>He is at thy right hand.
<br>Thy mercy, Lord, is great, and far above the heavens;
<br>Let none be made ashamed, that wait upon Thee.

With praise, O God, we worship Thee; 
<br>With song and prayer we bow the knee, 
<br>Accept our love, receive our praise;
<br>Direct our ways, throughout our days.
<br>Amen.

Dismiss us, Lord, with blessing, we pray;
<br>As from Thy worship we go our ways;
<br>Guide in life's conflicts, all through the day;
<br>Save in Thy kingdom, Thine be the praise.
<br>Amen.
